const PHRASE_DRAFTS = [
"Today | was a special day.","Ping the Panda | was going to choose | a pet.","For a month, | Ping had helped | at home.","He washed dishes with Mom, | put away his toys, | and helped clean the house.","Some days | he wanted to play instead.","But he remembered his promise | and finished his jobs.","You have worked hard, | Mom said.","Now we can look for a pet | our family can care for.",
"On the way to the pet shop, | Ping had many questions.","Would his pet have | feathers or fur?","Would it have scales?","Would it run, | swim, or fly?","I want a pet | I can play with, | he said.","Playing is important, | Mom replied.","What else | will your pet need?","Ping thought | for a moment.","Food, water, | and a safe home!","And care every day, | said Mom.",
"The shop was full | of sounds.","Birds chirped.","A puppy barked.","Something rustled | in a little bed.","Ping looked around | with wide eyes.","There were rabbits, fish, snakes, | kittens, and puppies.","How could he choose | just one?","First, | we will learn about them, | Mom said.","Then we will decide.","The shopkeeper smiled.","You can ask me questions.",
"Ping watched the birds | hop between their perches.","They are beautiful, | he said.","Next, | he met the rabbits.","One moved away | when he reached toward it.","Let it come to you, | Mom said softly.","Ping sat still.","Soon, | a rabbit sniffed | near his feet.","Then he watched the fish | swim through the water.","I like watching them, | Ping said.","But I think | I want a different pet.",
"The shopkeeper showed Ping | a red snake.","With the shopkeeper helping, | Ping watched it move slowly | across his arm.","Its tongue flicked out.","Ping laughed.","That tickles!","Every animal needs | the right home and care, | the shopkeeper explained.","Ping asked | what the snake needed.","He listened carefully.","There is a lot to learn, | he said.",
"A little gray kitten | peeped out of a bed.","Ping rolled a toy | across the floor.","The kitten jumped after it, | tumbled, and tried again.","Ping laughed so much | that his tummy shook.","I like this kitten!","he said.","Mom smiled.","We would need to feed it, | give it fresh water, | keep its home clean, | and make time to play.","I would help you | care for it.",
"Then a brown puppy | climbed beside Ping | and fell asleep against his leg.","I like this puppy too, | Ping whispered.","Mom and the shopkeeper | explained its daily needs.","Ping listened | and thought about school, | playing, and helping at home.","Can our family manage | all of that?","he asked.","Together, | they talked about their time | and what they could provide.","I think the kitten | is the right choice for us, | Ping said at last.",
"On the way home, | Ping named his kitten Tiger.","At home, | he and Mom | made a care plan.","Ping drew pictures | beside his jobs | so he could remember them.","Soon, | his friends called him outside.","I will come | after I help Tiger settle in, | he said.","Ping had worked hard | to earn a pet.","Now he understood | something more.","Choosing a pet | was the beginning of a promise.","And Ping was ready | to keep it."
];
const PHRASE_MAP=Object.fromEntries(PHRASE_DRAFTS.map(s=>[s.replaceAll('|','').replace(/[^a-z0-9 ]/gi,'').replace(/\s+/g,' ').trim().toLowerCase(),s.split('|').map(x=>x.trim())]));

