STRINGS.curriculumItems=["Responsibility: chores, saving and keeping promises.|Kindness: Nash and Mash, feelings, friendship and a safe home.|Our environment: Maxi’s pond, litter, recycling and ocean waste.|Community action: Ping and Popo’s teams protect Panda Valley Forest.|Healthy habits: food, exercise and everyday movement.|Learning: improve a school subject and develop a practical skill.|Belonging: welcome Jake the Polar Bear and explore his changing home.", "Tanggung jawab: tugas, menabung, dan janji.|Kebaikan: Nash dan Mash, perasaan, persahabatan, dan rumah aman.|Lingkungan: kolam Maxi, sampah, daur ulang, dan laut.|Aksi bersama: tim Ping dan Popo menjaga hutan.|Kebiasaan sehat: makanan, olahraga, dan gerak.|Belajar: tingkatkan pelajaran dan keterampilan.|Rasa diterima: sambut Jake si beruang kutub.", "责任：家务、储蓄和守诺。|善意：Nash与Mash、情感、友谊和安全的家。|环境：Maxi的池塘、垃圾、回收和海洋。|社区行动：平平和Popo的团队保护森林。|健康习惯：饮食、锻炼和日常活动。|学习：改善学校科目并培养实用技能。|归属感：欢迎北极熊Jake，了解他的家园。"];
